					"type": "text",
					"top": 60,
					"left": 40,
					"width": 340,
					"height": 160,
					"textAlign": "left",
					"fontWeight": "bold",
					"text": "The event \"On Column Resize\" is now generated \"live\", as long as the columns are resized by the user.\r\rIn the example below, the column widths are displayed in each column. Resize the columns to see the widths updated \"live\".\r\rThe color is set to blue when the column reaches its minimal width and to red when it reaches its maximum width."
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"objects": {
